{"4636750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loot The World: Three Kings", "steam_appid": 4636750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4764770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot the World: Three Kings</strong> is an RPG adventure where exploration, risk, and decision-making define your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a procedurally generated world, explore dangerous locations, and gather loot to grow stronger. Every action matters — every step could lead to treasure… or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is clear: <strong>find and defeat the Three Kings</strong> who rule this corrupted world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world full of danger and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons with unique events, traps, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice-based combat system with meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Run Mode with no saves and permadeath for a true hardcore experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruins, camps, and other unknown locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store system, merchants and management of your own stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot system with resources, items, and survival management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat with skills and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG progression with stats, skills, and character builds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Search. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location you visit can trigger events:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing… or something unexpected</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supplies, fatigue, and resources carefully, or your journey will end sooner than expected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the Three Kings, grow stronger, and defeat them…<br>if you survive long enough.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot the World: Three Kings</strong> is an RPG adventure where exploration, risk, and decision-making define your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a procedurally generated world, explore dangerous locations, and gather loot to grow stronger. Every action matters — every step could lead to treasure… or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is clear: <strong>find and defeat the Three Kings</strong> who rule this corrupted world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world full of danger and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons with unique events, traps, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice-based combat system with meaningful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Run Mode with no saves and permadeath for a true hardcore experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruins, camps, and other unknown locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store system, merchants and management of your own stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot system with resources, items, and survival management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat with skills and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG progression with stats, skills, and character builds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Search. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location you visit can trigger events:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing… or something unexpected</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supplies, fatigue, and resources carefully, or your journey will end sooner than expected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the Three Kings, grow stronger, and defeat them…<br>if you survive long enough.</p>", "short_description": "An infinite procedural RPG. Explore a dangerous world, roll the dice in combat, loot everything, and hunt down the Three Kings.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636750/cc43ed59322cfa691cb2dfda0ba541fc83841790/header.jpg?t=1779879087", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636750/8ec2fab7e676ef470645962c8b011ec744ce791f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779879087", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4636750/8ec2fab7e676ef470645962c8b011ec744ce791f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779879087", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU (optional)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Loot The Wolrd: Three Kings © 2026 SuleDev. All rights reserved.", "dev